          "Engage renters as a distinct constituency: at 36.3%, renters represent more than one-third of the district and face different economic concerns than homeowners (housing cost burden, lack of asset accumulation, landlord accountability); neglecting renter-specific issues in a homeowner-focused legislative agenda means neglecting a third of the constituency."
