          "Avoid any framing that positions Hispanic constituents as a separate or competing interest relative to the homeowner majority; the 62-38 margin is durable only if both communities perceive that the representative is governing for their shared economic security and community stability.",
          "Monitor whether the 38% Democratic opposition is concentrated geographically, demographically, or ideologically within the district; understanding where and why the opposition is strongest will reveal whether the seat's Republican foundation is truly stable or vulnerable to erosion in the next cycle."
