          "Establish a 2025-2026 constituent engagement infrastructure now: town halls, service delivery responsiveness, and visible presence in the district across all neighborhoods will create the organizational foundation necessary to defend a 2026 or 2028 challenge from a well-funded Republican who will certainly appear."
