          "Address affluent homeowner tax burden and property tax fairness explicitly; at $102,882 income and 74% white homeowner-majority, this constituency expects government to be fiscally responsible with their tax dollars. Specific commitments on tax structure and property tax management convert this demographic from assumed Republican base into swing voters who will split their ballots if they perceive fiscal mismanagement.",
          "Build a specific housing affordability platform for the 27.5% renter population and younger households: in a 50-50 race, renter turnout and candidate preference determine the margin. Demonstrate that you understand housing as a household economic concern, not a progressive abstract — and that state policy can address it without destabilizing the homeowner majority's financial security.",
