          "Maintain active local presence and constituent service in suburban precincts: unopposed elections create permission to reduce local engagement, which is precisely the moment when a credible Democratic challenger can establish foothold by demonstrating direct constituent attention.",
          "Ground messaging in material suburban concerns—school operations funding, road maintenance, fire-and-police response times, housing affordability—rather than abstract political positioning; this constituency evaluates on tangible service delivery."
