          "Engage the Latino and Black communities with specific attention to housing access and economic mobility—at 21.8% and 13.75% respectively, these communities experience higher housing insecurity than the white majority, and a representative who translates general Democratic principles into concrete anti-displacement and affordability action builds authentic durable support rather than assuming inherited partisan loyalty.",
