          "Treat the unopposed 2024 result as strategically ambiguous rather than reassuring: organize active constituent relationships now rather than waiting for opposition to emerge, because a credible challenger in 2026 will find real electoral stakes in this seat if the incumbent has not built visible, ongoing constituent engagement."
