          "Engage the 13.94% Hispanic/Latino community on workforce development, housing affordability for renters and first-time buyers, and equitable economic opportunity in a prosperous district where income and wealth gaps by ethnicity are likely significant; this community's loyalty is not guaranteed and requires demonstration of responsive governance.",
