          "Maintain constituent accessibility and perceived responsiveness at high volume — this is a district where 72.8% college-educated voters consume political information actively and expect rapid, substantive responses to legislative inquiries; neglecting constituent services is not a path to growth and is the likeliest path to erosion of the 66% base."
