          "Lead specifically with education policy that addresses college-educated voters' concerns: higher education access, student debt, school funding adequacy, and the relationship between local education quality and property values are the material concerns for a 23% college-attainment constituency with significant household investments in education.",
          "Build visible, consistent engagement with Hispanic and Asian communities now, before a Democratic challenger can claim ownership of these constituencies — economic mobility, healthcare access, and education opportunity are shared concerns across these communities and merit specific policy attention rather than generic minority outreach.",
