          "Avoid tax-the-rich rhetoric; instead emphasize ROI on infrastructure, schools, and services. High-income voters will fund public goods if convinced they work—show results.",
          "Build outreach to Asian residents (34.46%) and Hispanic/Latino residents (6%) around economic mobility, education access, and immigration as economic asset; these groups are politically engaged, affluent, and can shift margins."
